  "observations": [
    "The upstream Open POSIX sem_getvalue/1-1.c calls sem_open and sem_unlink. The threaded WASIp1 libc omits sem_unlink. The unnamed semaphore test has a separate result.",
    "In upstream libc-test search_lsearch.c, lsearch copies the declared 80 bytes from its key. The original program passes shorter string literals. Both engines report a memory tag mismatch with MTE enabled. The full-width record port has its own row.",
    "Every upstream skip and unresolved exit remains in its own engine count."
  ],
